          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The half-life of a radioactive substance is the amount of time that must elapse for the mass to decay down to exactly half of what it was originally.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p23-q16-illustration-paragraph",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For example, the half-life of uranium-232 is approximately 68.9 years. This means that a 100 kg mass of uranium-232 will decay down to 50 kg after 68.9 years, and again down to 25 kg after another 68.9 years, and so on.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p23-q16-model-intro",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The equation for half-life is given by",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p23-q16-model",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "center",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "M=M_0\\left(\\frac12\\right)^{\\frac{t}{H}}",
              "display": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p23-q16-variables",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "where ",
              "marks": []
            },
